sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant App as Time Tracker (browser)
    participant LS as localStorage
    participant API as Productive API

    U->>App: Enter API token + organization ID
    Note over App,API: include=person is mandatory: without it the person<br/>relationship carries no data and no ID at all
    App->>API: GET /organization_memberships?include=person
    alt 401 invalid_auth_token
        API-->>App: errors[]
        App-->>U: "Check your API token"
    else 403 no_person
        API-->>App: errors[]
        App-->>U: "That token has no person in organization X"
    else network error
        App-->>U: Inline error on login form
    else 200
        API-->>App: membership + included person
        App->>App: read relationships.person.data.id
        Note over App,API: /services is organization-wide; filter[person_id]<br/>is silently ignored (A-1)
        App->>API: GET /services?filter[time_tracking_enabled]=true (sparse, page[size]=200)
        App->>App: sort by name, take the first as default service
        App->>LS: save { token, organizationId, personId, defaultServiceId }
        App-->>U: redirect to /day/today
    end

    Note over App,LS: On refresh: read LS, re-validate with one<br/>GET /organization_memberships?include=person
    U->>App: Logout
    App->>LS: clear key
    App->>App: clear query cache, redirect /login
